OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with outbreaks of light rain
OL,7,Fpossible. Overnight heavy rain spreads
OL,8,Feastwards across the region. Brisk
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly winds, perhaps strong
OL,10,Fwith risk of coastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,13,Fspreading eastwards and clearing by
OL,14,Fmidday. Then a largely dry afternoon
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells developing, but also
OL,16,Fa few showers. Strong winds easing
OL,17,Fthrough the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
